@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
actor "Fan A" as A
actor "Fan C" as C
participant "Inventory" as I
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "Sweeper\n(every 5 s)" as SW
queue "Kafka" as K
A -> I : hold seat 101 (expires 10:07:00)
note over A : closes the laptop
... 10:07:00 passes, the sweeper has not run yet ...
C -> I : hold seat 101 (10:07:02, from a stale map)
I -> PG : UPDATE ... WHERE state = AVAILABLE\nOR (state = HELD AND expires_at < now())
PG --> I : 1 row: lazy expiry, C wins
I --> C : 201
SW -> PG : SELECT expired HELD rows\nLIMIT 500 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
PG --> SW : seats 205-208 (nobody tried them)
SW -> PG : UPDATE -> AVAILABLE; outbox SeatsReleased; COMMIT
PG -> K : (relay) SeatsReleased
note over K : the map now shows 205-208 as free
@enduml
